  "descripcion": "Scandinavia expansion features Sweden, Norway and Denmark, you'll be exploring mile upon mile across these three beautiful Nordic countries. New ferry terminals also allow you to board ferries directly and to discover 29 Scandinavian cities, new industries, with over 80 new cargo.",
